%
(TCPC H3 tool-length visibility check)
(No probing. No physical tool installed. Selects T3 and applies G43 H3.)
(This check keeps programmed XYZ fixed and rotates B/C so the TCPC XYZ)
(compensation is easy to see in the motor command DRO/logs.)

G17 G21 G40 G49 G54 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G92.1 G94

o<preview_guard> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
  (DEBUG, TCPC_H3_TOOL_LENGTH_VISIBILITY_CHECK preview only)
  M2
o<preview_guard> endif

o<tlo_start_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]>] GT 0.001]
  (abort, TCPC H3 visibility check requires zero active Z tool offset at start)
o<tlo_start_check> endif
o<tcpc_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC H3 visibility check must start with TCPC off)
o<tcpc_off_check> endif
o<twp_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.motion_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC H3 visibility check must start with TWP motion off)
o<twp_off_check> endif
o<b_zero_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[headheadtwp.current_joint_b]>] GT 0.05]
  (abort, TCPC H3 visibility check must start near B0)
o<b_zero_check> endif
o<c_zero_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[headheadtwp.current_joint_c]>] GT 0.05]
  (abort, TCPC H3 visibility check must start near C0)
o<c_zero_check> endif

(MSG, Confirm no physical tool installed. Virtual H3 is active. Clearance required for about +/-155mm X/Y and -42mm Z compensation.)
M0

M61 Q3
M66 E0 L0 (force sync after selected-tool change)
o<tool_3_check> if [ABS[#<_current_tool> - 3] GT 0.5]
  (abort, M61 Q3 did not set current tool 3)
o<tool_3_check> endif

G0 B0.0 C0.0
G43 H3
M66 E0 L0 (force sync after applying H3 tool length)
o<h3_z_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]> - 128.606729] GT 0.002]
  (abort, G43 H3 did not apply expected H3 Z tool length)
o<h3_z_check> endif

#<start_x> = #<_x>
#<start_y> = #<_y>
#<start_z> = #<_z>

G43.4
o<tcpc_on_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> LT 0.5]
  (abort, G43.4 did not enable TCPC)
o<tcpc_on_check> endif

(At B0 C0. Note X/Y/Z motor command before continuing.)
M0

F3000
G1 X[#<start_x>] Y[#<start_y>] Z[#<start_z>] B30.0 C0.0
(At B30 C0. Expected H3-added effect versus zero-tool case is about +64.3 X and -17.2 Z; total TCPC compensation is about +154 X and -42 Z from B0.)
M0

G1 X[#<start_x>] Y[#<start_y>] Z[#<start_z>] B0.0 C0.0
(Back at B0 C0.)
M0

G1 X[#<start_x>] Y[#<start_y>] Z[#<start_z>] B-30.0 C0.0
(At B-30 C0. Expected H3-added effect versus zero-tool case is about -64.3 X and -17.2 Z; total TCPC compensation is about -154 X and -42 Z from B0.)
M0

G1 X[#<start_x>] Y[#<start_y>] Z[#<start_z>] B0.0 C0.0
G1 X[#<start_x>] Y[#<start_y>] Z[#<start_z>] B30.0 C90.0
(At B30 C90. Expected H3-added effect versus zero-tool case is about +64.3 Y and -17.2 Z.)
M0

G1 X[#<start_x>] Y[#<start_y>] Z[#<start_z>] B0.0 C0.0

G49.1
o<tcpc_off_end_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, G49.1 did not disable TCPC)
o<tcpc_off_end_check> endif

G49
M66 E0 L0 (force sync after clearing tool length)
o<tlo_end_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]>] GT 0.001]
  (abort, G49 did not clear virtual H3 tool length)
o<tlo_end_check> endif
M61 Q0

(DEBUG, TCPC_H3_TOOL_LENGTH_VISIBILITY_CHECK complete)
M30
%
